  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -AR verb; follows standard endings throughout",
    "Past participle: armado (regular)",
    "*Armar* = to assemble/put together: *armar los ñoquis con un tenedor* = to shape the gnocchi with a fork",
    "*Armar* = to arm (with weapons): *armar al ejército* = to arm the army",
    "*Armar un lío/escándalo* = to cause trouble/a scene",
    "*Armarse de paciencia* = to arm oneself with patience",
    "Related: el arma (weapon), armado (armed/assembled), el armario (wardrobe — things that are \"armed\"/fitted)"
  ],
